roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21586,"speakerName":"Magnifico","textMapHash":3750821194,"text":"#Haha, my dear {NICKNAME} and Paimon, my muse and my... Err, mini-muse!","nextNodeIds":[750711002]},{"nodeId":750711002,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21586,"speakerName":"Magnifico","textMapHash":3556468914,"text":"#Ah yes, and {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}, of course!","nextNodeIds":[750711003]},{"nodeId":750711003,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1207370970,"text":"Hah! Who's the mini-me here, anyway?","nextNodeIds":[750711004]},{"nodeId":750711004,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":1055676850,"text":"Raaawr!","nextNodeIds":[750711005]},{"nodeId":750711005,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21586,"speakerName":"Magnifico","textMapHash":4282522626,"text":"Haha, come now, don't mind me.","nextNodeIds":[750711006]},{"nodeId":750711006,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2956916842,"text":"Hmph, Paimon minds a lot!","nextNodeIds":[750711007,750711011]},{"nodeId":750711007,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1186268450,"text":"Newly-inspired, are we?","nextNodeIds":[750711008]},{"nodeId":750711008,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21586,"speakerName":"Magnifico","textMapHash":7309026,"text":"Of course! However... Hehe, new inspiration means... that I'll need your help once more.","nextNodeIds":[750711009]},{"nodeId":750711009,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3028171506,"text":"No problem! You pay every time, anyway.","nextNodeIds":[750711010]},{"nodeId":750711010,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21586,"speakerName":"Magnifico","textMapHash":2145110738,"text":"Haha, wonderful, my little mercenary!","nextNodeIds":[750711017]},{"nodeId":750711017,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21586,"speakerName":"Magnifico","textMapHash":3662664866,"text":"You see, I'm taking a photo of a Tepetlisaurus this time... Shh. Careful now, we don't want to disturb it.","nextNodeIds":[750711018]},{"nodeId":750711018,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21586,"speakerName":"Magnifico","textMapHash":2243878362,"text":"This is my first time interacting with such a Saurian, but I've been observing them for a while now... Truly fascinating creatures they are, each with unique personalities beneath their hardened shells.","nextNodeIds":[750711019]},{"nodeId":750711019,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21586,"speakerName":"Magnifico","textMapHash":3832733090,"text":"Hehe, this one's learned some basic commands after being fed a few times, to boot.","nextNodeIds":[750711020]},{"nodeId":750711020,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21586,"speakerName":"Magnifico","textMapHash":3430656338,"text":"Still, I'm going to need your help, dear Saurian tamers, to bring the wayward Saurian with us and take a photo of it interacting with its fellow Tepetlisaurs.","nextNodeIds":[750711021]},{"nodeId":750711021,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21586,"speakerName":"Magnifico","textMapHash":3068596970,"text":"Hehe, a simple task, eh?","nextNodeIds":[750711022]},{"nodeId":750711022,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1260819738,"text":"Yup, super easy!","nextNodeIds":[750711023,750711024]},{"nodeId":750711023,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4088404618,"text":"(Not that you're the one who actually has to do it...)","nextNodeIds":[750711025]},{"nodeId":750711025,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21586,"speakerName":"Magnifico","textMapHash":1089406034,"text":"Haha, yes, that's the spirit! Come then, bring me the stray Tepetlisaurus, and we can begin!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":750711024,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":34925962,"text":"(And it's not as simple as you might think...!)","nextNodeIds":[750711025]},{"nodeId":750711011,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":165022738,"text":"Require ye the succor of your... mousses once more, then?","nextNodeIds":[750711012]},{"nodeId":750711012,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":556559658,"text":"Mousse... Heh, Paimon's feeling hungry already...","nextNodeIds":[750711013]},{"nodeId":750711013,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":2854696890,"text":"Groo... Groo...","nextNodeIds":[750711014]},{"nodeId":750711014,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21586,"speakerName":"Magnifico","textMapHash":1925863242,"text":"Uh, you mean \"muses,\" don't you? Those aren't for eating!","nextNodeIds":[750711015]},{"nodeId":750711015,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3029521266,"text":"Well, so long as you're paying, that Mora will soon become food!","nextNodeIds":[750711016]},{"nodeId":750711016,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21586,"speakerName":"Magnifico","textMapHash":1132644930,"text":"Whatever you say, Paimon... But I do indeed have money, so you shan't have to worry about working for free!","nextNodeIds":[750711017]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7507110,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133509098,133509276"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_GROUP_LUA"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","1471"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_LOCK_POINT"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133509018,3"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO